      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>“Installation of Congregation Officers” was written by Rabbi Jacob Bosniak sometime before 1924 when the congregation celebrated the breaking of ground in the construction of the Ocean Parkway Jewish Center. The prayer was first published in Rabbi Bosniak’s לקוטי תפלות <tei:hi rend="italic">Liḳutei Tefilot: Pulpit and Public Prayers</tei:hi> (1927), pp. 115-116.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
